      "postDescription": "PRIMARY PURPOSE：\n1. To perform connector product tests per related standard/specifications.\n2. To support test engineer to complete failure analysis.\n\nDUTIES & RESPONSIBILITIES:\n1. Conducts product vibration/mechanical shock, Circuit Continuity tests according to standard, specification, and SOP.  根据相关标准和作业指导书，按要求执行产品振动/机械冲击性能测试,电连续性测试。\n2. Record test raw data and prepare test report. 做好试验过程的原始记录，并出具测试报告。\n3. Maintain test equipment to work normal.  维护保养测试设备，确保设备正常运行。\n4. Main Lab 7S to meet requirement. 维护实验室7S以满足相关要求。\n5. Carry out special assignments/projects assigned by his/her supervisor. \n完成主管安排的其他工作。\n\nSKILLS & ABILITIES:\n1. Engineering graduate (Electrical or Mechanical) from a recognized college or technical secondary school.理工科大专以上或同等学历\n2. Min 2 years’ experience working in vibration test field.\n至少2年振动测试工作经验。\n3. Able to communicate (reading and writing with tool) in English. 具备基本的英文读写能力（可借助工具）。\n4. Knowledge of Windows office software (Excel and word). 熟练掌握 Windows Office 办公软件 (Excel和Word)。\n5. Ability to operate Vibration/shock test equipment. 能操作振动/冲击测试设备。\n6. Basic maintenance skills of vibration test equipment. 有基本的振动设备维护保养技能。",
